  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ni Mama Project - Support for Women Human Rights Defenders in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports women human rights defenders (WHRDs) through capacity development and protection of WHRDs at risk in five counties in Kenya, through solidarity networks, women specific protection support, skills building, monitoring and documentation and creating visibility of women&apos;s role in promoting human rights. The project targets WHRDs and human rights organisations championing women&apos;s rights, with the aim of increased collaboartion and action between these.</narrative>
  </description>
